# Data pipeline rules

- Ingest on a schedule (cron/job), not on every user request
- Cache: live ~15–30s, fixtures ~5–15m, standings ~1h, historical ~24h, news ~15–30m
- Always map provider IDs through `external_ids` to Gameplan canonical IDs
- Raw JSON under `data/raw/`; processed artifacts under `data/processed/`
- Models under `data/models/` with versioned filenames and metadata
- Prediction models must ship with backtest metrics; baseline Elo/Poisson before ensembles
- Do not scrape sources that disallow it; prefer APIs / licensed open data
- Log rate-limit remaining and quota usage on every provider call batch
